---
import {site} from '../config/site.mjs';
const isDemo=site.mode==='demo';
---
<section class="cinema" aria-labelledby="cinema-heading">
  <div class="cinema-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cinema-aura cinema-aura-one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cinema-aura cinema-aura-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container cinema-main">
    <div class="cinema-content">
      <p class="cinema-overline"><span class="signal"></span> EZERWRIGHT / DIGITAL EXPERIENCES</p>
      <h1 id="cinema-heading">Your business deserves a website that <em>feels ahead.</em></h1>
      <p class="cinema-lead">Distinctive design. Thoughtful interactions. A clear next step for your customers. Built for real service businesses—not another forgettable template.</p>
      <div class="cinema-actions">
        <a class="cinema-primary" href="#cinema-work">Explore the experiences <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="cinema-secondary" href="/contact/">Start a project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="cinema-offer"><strong>US$500</strong> for a defined five-page website <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> $250 to start after written approval <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> Client-owned files</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cinema-stage" role="img" aria-label="Original animated concept: layers of a traditional website unfold into a refined service-business website with enquiry actions.">
      <div class="stage-ring ring-one"></div><div class="stage-ring ring-two"></div>
      <div class="stage-glow"></div>
      <div class="website-layer layer-back">
        <div class="layer-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>BEFORE / STRUCTURE</b></div>
        <div class="wireframe-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="wireframe-cols"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="website-layer layer-mid">
        <div class="layer-tag">02 / INTERACTION</div>
        <div class="interaction-ring"><span>+</span></div>
        <div class="layer-progress"><span></span></div>
        <p>From browsing<br/>to an enquiry.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="website-layer layer-front">
        <div class="front-top"><span class="front-brand">FIELDNOTES <i>—</i></span><span class="front-nav">SERVICES&nbsp;&nbsp; WORK&nbsp;&nbsp; CONTACT</span></div>
        <div class="front-image"><span class="image-horizon"></span><div class="front-arc arc-one"></div><div class="front-arc arc-two"></div><div class="front-sun"></div><span class="front-image-note">A BETTER FIRST IMPRESSION</span></div>
        <div class="front-copy"><span class="front-kicker">CONCEPT / SERVICE BUSINESS</span><strong>Make every first impression count.</strong><span class="front-cta">Request an estimate <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="float-note note-one"><span class="float-dot"></span> Motion with meaning</div>
      <div class="float-note note-two">01 — 03 <span>✧</span></div>
      <span class="stage-caption">CONCEPT VISUALIZATION / NO CLIENT WORK SHOWN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container cinema-bottom"><span>DESIGN THAT EARNS ATTENTION</span><span>BUILT FOR CLARITY, NOT JUST THE SCREENSHOT</span><a href="#cinema-work">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</section>
<section class="cinema-work" id="cinema-work" aria-labelledby="cinema-work-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="work-intro"><div><p class="work-kicker">01 / WHAT'S POSSIBLE</p><h2 id="cinema-work-heading">Not another template.<br/><em>A distinctive experience.</em></h2></div><p>Explore three fictional, interactive website directions. Each shows how a service business could guide visitors from discovery to enquiry. These are agency-made concepts, not commissioned client projects.</p></div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      <a href="/showcase/exterior/" class="work-card exterior">
        <span class="work-top"><b>01 / RINSE & RISE</b><span>EXPLORE ↗</span></span>
        <div class="work-art wash-art"><div class="wash-disc"></div><div class="wash-line one"></div><div class="wash-line two"></div><span>PURE<br/>IMPACT<span class="work-dot">.</span></span></div>
        <span class="work-bottom"><strong>Exterior cleaning</strong><small>Confident, kinetic and conversion-led</small></span>
        <span class="concept-note">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/showcase/pool/" class="work-card pool">
        <span class="work-top"><b>02 / BLUE HOUR</b><span>EXPLORE ↗</span></span>
        <div class="work-art pool-art"><div class="pool-circle one"></div><div class="pool-circle two"></div><div class="pool-circle three"></div><span>BEYOND<br/>THE BLUE.</span></div>
        <span class="work-bottom"><strong>Pool care</strong><small>Calm, luminous and beautifully considered</small></span>
        <span class="concept-note">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/showcase/landscape/" class="work-card landscape">
        <span class="work-top"><b>03 / STONE & STREAM</b><span>EXPLORE ↗</span></span>
        <div class="work-art landscape-art"><div class="landform a"></div><div class="landform b"></div><div class="landform c"></div><span>GROUND<br/>WORK.</span></div>
        <span class="work-bottom"><strong>Landscaping</strong><small>Editorial, grounded and distinctive</small></span>
        <span class="concept-note">FICTIONAL INTERACTIVE CONCEPT</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="work-end"><span>Built as concept experiences. No borrowed testimonials, client claims or fabricated results.</span><a href="/services/">View the complete $500 website scope <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="cinema-closing" aria-labelledby="cinema-closing-heading">
  <div class="container closing-inner">
    <p class="work-kicker">02 / FROM IDEA TO OWNERSHIP</p>
    <h2 id="cinema-closing-heading">A striking first impression.<br/><em>A practical business website.</em></h2>
    <p>Five marketing pages, a real enquiry route, responsive layouts, basic on-page SEO, two consolidated revision rounds and portable source. No mandatory hosting contract and no promises of guaranteed sales.</p>
    <div class="closing-steps"><span>01 <b>Define</b></span><span>02 <b>Build</b></span><span>03 <b>Review</b></span><span>04 <b>Hand over</b></span></div>
    <a href="/contact/?service=website" class="cinema-primary">Discuss your website <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <p class="closing-small">US$250 after approved scope · US$250 after accepted staging · Optional future work quoted separately</p>
  </div>
</section>

